{"catalog_version": 1, "point_id": "NP-1", "task_id": "corpus-04-LightGCN-NP-1-A-1-zh", "fields": {"claim": "11304e299fe1db7daf6d27bbc7f4470d850c3f1626b4e8ac076a290ed6051a12", "claim_en": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "technical_features[0]": "a2c46ceb8e862b1c433d07ff7a75b6532e6c995021c474425d3ddbdaefccbd56", "technical_features[1]": "6d2588ab291765e937bca7fcc50a58ad5dc0e20c29f276c0acec906df71e85e7", "technical_features[2]": "f4e116ebd2d52a88cb98e9c6a95c6e3ca9cd962e8fcdff38b774768c70f69949"}, "sources": [{"source_id": "S-14153b1d61a6628e-001", "field": "claim", "field_index": null, "language": "zh", "start": 0, "end": 48, "text": "提出LightGCN，通过去除特征变换和非线性激活、保留邻域聚合，简化用于协同过滤的图卷积网络。", "sha256": "11304e299fe1db7daf6d27bbc7f4470d850c3f1626b4e8ac076a290ed6051a12"}, {"source_id": "S-14153b1d61a6628e-002", "field": "technical_features", "field_index": 0, "language": "zh", "start": 0, "end": 20, "text": "在用户与物品交互图上对嵌入进行线性传播。", "sha256": "a2c46ceb8e862b1c433d07ff7a75b6532e6c995021c474425d3ddbdaefccbd56"}, {"source_id": "S-14153b1d61a6628e-003", "field": "technical_features", "field_index": 1, "language": "zh", "start": 0, "end": 21, "text": "去掉特征变换和非线性激活，只保留邻域聚合。", "sha256": "6d2588ab291765e937bca7fcc50a58ad5dc0e20c29f276c0acec906df71e85e7"}, {"source_id": "S-14153b1d61a6628e-004", "field": "technical_features", "field_index": 2, "language": "zh", "start": 0, "end": 21, "text": "对所有层学到的嵌入加权求和，形成最终嵌入。", "sha256": "f4e116ebd2d52a88cb98e9c6a95c6e3ca9cd962e8fcdff38b774768c70f69949"}]}